      "In the Chats inbox, each conversation shows what state it's in. At a glance you know what Sara is chasing and what has already&nbsp;rebooked.",
    estados: [
      { tag: '📨 Follow-up', desc: 'Sara tried again to reach out. The counter (×3) shows how many times.' },
      { tag: 'Booked', desc: 'The patient rebooked from the win-back.' },
      { tag: '⏰ Reminder', desc: "Sara reminds them of the appointment the day before so it doesn't fall through again." },
      { tag: '✅ Confirmed', desc: "The patient confirmed they're coming. The slot is yours." },
    ],
    faqs: [
      { q: 'Who does Sara win back?', a: "Three groups: those who canceled or didn't show, those who dropped off mid-conversation without booking, and the patient who hasn't returned in months. We define the timing and treatment criteria with you during onboarding." },
      { q: 'How does she build the waitlist?', a: "When someone asks for a time that's booked, Sara notes it down. If that time opens up from a cancellation, she automatically offers it to whoever was waiting, in order." },
      { q: "Doesn't she end up bothering patients?", a: "She doesn't send mass blasts. She messages when there's a real reason (an appointment left pending, a slot that opened up), retries in moderation and always respects anyone who asks to stop receiving messages. The goal is to bring back the people who choose you, not to annoy them." },
      { q: 'How many times does she follow up?', a: 'As many as make sense, no more. In the dashboard you see the follow-up counter (📨 Follow-up ×3) per conversation. When the patient replies or asks her to stop, Sara stops.' },
      { q: 'Does this collect payment too?', a: 'Yes. When she wins someone back or fills a gap, Sara can ask for the deposit in the same conversation, just like any booking. The slot comes back filled and already paid.' },
      { q: 'Which channels does she win back through?', a: "Wherever the patient reached out: WhatsApp, Instagram or your website chat. It's the same Sara across all three, with that person's history." },
    ],
  },
}[lang];

const { steps, estados, faqs } = dict;
---

<Layout lang={lang}
  title={dict.metaTitle}
  description={dict.metaDescription}
>
  <Header lang={lang} />
  <main>
    <PageHero
      lang={lang}
      eyebrow={dict.heroEyebrow}
      title={dict.heroTitle}
      lead={dict.heroLead}
      image="/img/hero/reactivacion-hero.jpg"
      imageAlt={dict.heroImageAlt}
      imageW={1200}
      imageH={900}
    />

    <!-- ══════════ TIRA DE MECÁNICA (no son stats inventadas: es lo que hace) ══════════ -->
    <section class="border-b border-line bg-paper">
      <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-8 px-5 py-10 sm:grid-cols-3">
        <div class="py-2">
          <p class="font-serif text-lg font-black text-ink">{dict.strip[0].t}</p>
          <p class="mt-1 text-salvia">{dict.strip[0].b}</p>
        </div>
        <div class="py-2 sm:border-l sm:border-line sm:pl-8">
          <p class="font-serif text-lg font-black text-ink">{dict.strip[1].t}</p>
          <p class="mt-1 text-salvia">{dict.strip[1].b}</p>
        </div>
        <div class="py-2 sm:border-l sm:border-line sm:pl-8">
          <p class="font-serif text-lg font-black text-ink">{dict.strip[2].t}</p>
          <p class="mt-1 text-salvia">{dict.strip[2].b}</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ══════════ CÓMO LO HACE SARA · conversación real ══════════ -->
    <section class="border-t border-line">
      <div class="reveal mx-auto grid max-w-6xl items-center gap-14 px-5 py-24 md:grid-cols-[1.05fr_0.95fr]">
        <div>
          <p class="mb-3 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-pine-dark">{dict.howKicker}</p>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl font-black leading-tight text-balance md:text-4xl">
            {dict.howH2}
          </h2>
          <p class="mt-5 text-lg text-salvia">
            {dict.howP1}
          </p>
          <p class="mt-4 text-salvia" set:html={dict.howP2} />
        </div>
        <div class="flex justify-center md:justify-end">
          <ConversationDemo
            lang={lang}
            channel="whatsapp"
            bubbles={dict.howBubbles}
          />
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ══════════ CÓMO FUNCIONA · 3 tiempos (banda oscura) ══════════ -->
    <section class="border-t border-line bg-ink text-cream">
      <div class="reveal mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-24">
        <h2 class="max-w-2xl font-serif text-3xl font-black leading-tight text-balance md:text-4xl" set:html={dict.stepsH2} />
        <div class="mt-14 grid gap-x-10 gap-y-12 md:grid-cols-3">
          {
            steps.map((s) => (
              <div>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
                  <span class="font-serif text-4xl font-black text-mint tabular-nums">{s.n}</span>
                  <span class="h-px flex-1 bg-cream/15" />
                </div>
                <h3 class="mt-5 text-xl font-semibold text-cream">{s.title}</h3>
                <p class="mt-2 text-cream/65">{s.body}</p>
              </div>
            ))
          }
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ══════════ CAPACIDADES · filas alternadas (copy + visual) ══════════ -->
    <section class="border-t border-line">
      <div class="reveal mx-auto flex max-w-6xl flex-col gap-24 px-5 py-24">
        <FeatureRow
          eyebrow={dict.row1Eyebrow}
          title={dict.row1Title}
          body={dict.row1Body}
          points={dict.row1Points}
        >
          <!-- GEMINI: reemplazar por render de una agenda con huecos resaltados que se van llenando. Placeholder: imagen existente. -->
          <AgendaPanel lang={lang} class="w-full" />
        </FeatureRow>

        <FeatureRow
          flip
          eyebrow={dict.row2Eyebrow}
          title={dict.row2Title}
          body={dict.row2Body}
          points={dict.row2Points}
        >
          <ConversationDemo
            lang={lang}
            channel="whatsapp"
            bubbles={dict.row2Bubbles}
          />
        </FeatureRow>

        <FeatureRow
          eyebrow={dict.row3Eyebrow}
          title={dict.row3Title}
          body={dict.row3Body}
        >
          <ConversationDemo
            lang={lang}
            channel="instagram"
            bubbles={dict.row3Bubbles}
          />
        </FeatureRow>

        <FeatureRow
          flip
          eyebrow={dict.row4Eyebrow}
          title={dict.row4Title}
          body={dict.row4Body}
          points={dict.row4Points}
        >
          <ConversationDemo
            lang={lang}
            channel="whatsapp"
